<text x="57" y="133" font-family="DejaVu Sans, sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#171717">requirement Delivery</text>
<text x="57" y="168" font-family="DejaVu Sans, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#171717">immutable typed attributes</text>
<text x="57" y="190" font-family="DejaVu Sans, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#171717">one formal doc</text>
<rect x="535" y="110" width="330" height="190" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#171717"/>
<rect x="535" y="110" width="330" height="34" fill="#eeeeee" stroke="#171717"/>
<text x="547" y="133" font-family="DejaVu Sans, sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#171717">verificationCase Startup</text>
<text x="547" y="168" font-family="DejaVu Sans, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#171717">verify Delivery</text>
<text x="547" y="190" font-family="DejaVu Sans, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#171717">named routed publish step</text>
<line x1="375" y1="205" x2="535" y2="205" stroke="#171717" stroke-dasharray="5 4"/>
<text x="400.0" y="193.0" font-family="DejaVu Sans, sans-serif" font-size="12" fill="#171717">intent</text>
<text x="45" y="345" font-family="DejaVu Sans, sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#171717">satisfy and verify links are intent; a witness requires separate evidence.</text>
</svg>

